Visceral Sensory Grounding: Preserve tactile textures and sensory details 
without flattening into generic prose.\n2. Distinct Character Voices: Marcus is 
gritty, clipped, blue-collar machinist; Elena is sharp, articulate legal 
precision; Toby is youthful vulnerability.\n3. Kinetic Rhythm: Keep sentence 
structures tight and breathless in action scenes.\n4. Anti-Literalism: Transpose
idioms naturally; never translate word-for-word.\n5. Inviolable Glossaries: 
Strictly adhere to the canonical terms below.\n6. Output ONLY the clean 
translation with all markdown and formatting intact.\n\n\nCANONICAL GLOSSARY 
(Strictly enforce these exact translations):\n# O.N.E. Canonical Glossary — 
Spanish (es)\nOpen Networked Earth -> Open Networked Earth (Tierra Abierta y 
Conectada)\nO.N.E. -> O.N.E.\nUsufruct -> Usufructo\nUniversal Usufruct -> 
Usufructo Universal\nSortition -> Sorteo\nRotational Sortition -> Sorteo 
Rotativo\nClass 0 Invariants -> Invariantes de Clase 0\nThermodynamic Accounting
-> Contabilidad Termodinámica\nThermodynamic Balance -> Equilibrio 
Termodinámico\nHeretic's Commons -> Bienes Comunes del Hereje\nCommunity Land 
Trust -> Fideicomiso de Tierras Comunitarias (CLT)\nEcological Carrying Capacity
-> Capacidad de Carga Ecológica\nDeterministic Diverse Double-Compilation -> 
Doble Compilación Diversa Determinista (DDC)\nThreshold Multi-Party Computation 
-> Computación Multipartita por Umbral (t-MPC)\nZero-Knowledge 
Proof-of-Personhood -> Prueba de Personalidad de Conocimiento Cero 
(ZK-PoP)\nExternal Trade Interface -> Interfaz de Comercio Exterior 
(ETI)\nDelray Foundry -> Fundición de Delray\nAmbassador Bridge -> Puente 
Ambassador\nRiver Rouge -> River Rouge\nZug Island -> Zug Island\nAegis-Apex -> 
Aegis-Apex\nMeridian -> Meridian\nBlackiron -> Blackiron\nMarcus Vance -> Marcus
Vance\nElena Cruz -> Elena Cruz\nToby Morales -> Toby Morales\nMaya Lin-Mercado 
-> Maya Lin-Mercado\nRay Miller -> Ray Miller\nKira Vance -> Kira Vance\nSully 
-> Sully\nCampbell -> Campbell\nLeo -> Leo\nSarah -> Sarah\nMateo -> Mateo\nFCI 
Milan -> FCI Milan\nWest Jefferson -> West Jefferson\nDearborn Street -> 
Dearborn Street\nSandwich -> Sandwich\nWindsor -> Windsor\nDetroit -> 
Detroit\n\n\nText to translate:\n{text}"
}
